  "bodyHash": "f27867c17ded1bd1",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Better Tridents 為三叉戟帶來了一些小型但非常重要的改進。特別是 loyalty 附魔變得更加實用，甚至還有三叉戟本身的製作配方！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三叉戟終於有了製作配方！海礦中的所有三個遠古守卫，每一個都會掉落一個新的三叉戟碎片道具。將這三種碎片與一些海晶石碎塊結合，就能打造你的全新三叉戟！</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">當三叉戟耐久度接近耗盡時，使用一些海晶石碎塊在鐵砧上維修三叉戟。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">三叉戟被撿起時，必定會回到丟出時所在的欄位。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">附魔了 loyalty 後，三叉戟意外掉入虛空時會飛回而不是從世界中刪除。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">生物掉落的所有戰利品（包括物品和經驗值）會隨著附魔了 loyalty 的三叉戟一同飛向你。</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">▶️ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">impaling 的行為與 Bedrock Edition 一致：任何與水或雨接觸的生物都會受到增加的傷害，而不僅限於指定的水生生物種類。</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端需要安裝 &amp; 伺服器需要安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若該模組支援，可透過模組選單直接在遊戲中進行設定（需要 Fabric 上安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本上，也必須安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定時，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定檔類型。並非所有模組都擁有所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/SimplySarc\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">SimplySarc</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 透過其影片 </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KNwi8gPengY&amp;t=74s\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Improving The Update Aquatic</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中啟發了三叉戟的製作機制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/releasehun\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">releaseHUN</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創造了那個精美的三叉戟碎片紋理。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/zero_dsrs_vx\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Zero_DSRS_VX</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 來自其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repairable-tridents-fabric\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Repairable Tridents</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，提供了使用海晶石碎塊在鐵砧上修復三叉戟的點子。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/overflowing-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bartering-station\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fast-item-frames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fastitemframes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
